src/lib/color/apca.ts

  Implements the APCA (Advanced Perceptual Contrast Algorithm) W3 constant set
  for version 0.1.9. The implementation is original to this project; the
  algorithm and its constants are APCA's.

  Source: https://github.com/Myndex/apca-w3
  APCA is subject to a limited W3 license and is a draft, not a W3C standard.
  The reference package `apca-w3` is used in tests only (see section 3).

