3. Development and test only — never distributed
================================================================================

These are devDependencies imported exclusively by tests. They are not part of
any build output. Keeping them out of `src/` is a hard rule (see CONTRIBUTING.md)
because `colorparsley` is AGPL-3.0 and would otherwise impose copyleft on the
distributed application.

  apca-w3       — Limited W3 License   — used by src/lib/__tests__/apca.test.ts
  colorparsley  — AGPL-3.0            — used by src/lib/__tests__/apca.test.ts

